      "title": "Requirement 6: retries and double-clicks must be harmless",
      "text": "Mobile apps retry and users double-click. `startCheckout` is keyed by an idempotency key: `computeIfAbsent` runs the body once and later calls get the first answer. Payment has the same protection twice over: the gateway ignores a repeated key, and `pay` returns `PAID` for an already-confirmed hold.",
