          "file": "CheckoutService.startCheckout",
          "body": "/** Step 1 of checkout: revalidate, then take a time-boxed hold (or join the waitlist). */\npublic CheckoutResult startCheckout(String userId, String productId, int qty,\n                                    long priceSeenCents, String idempotencyKey) {\n    // A retry with the same key gets the original answer back and takes no extra stock.\n    return byIdempotencyKey.computeIfAbsent(idempotencyKey,\n            k -> begin(userId, productId, qty, priceSeenCents));\n}\n"
