      "title": "Requirement 7: revalidate price and quantity at checkout",
      "text": "The cart is stale by definition. At checkout we re-read the price (reject with `PRICE_CHANGED` and nothing is held) and reject impossible quantities up front. That last check matters: a buyer asking for 2 of a 1-unit product would otherwise sit at the head of the waitlist forever and block everyone behind them.",
