          "file": "CheckoutService.begin",
          "body": "private CheckoutResult begin(String userId, String productId, int qty, long priceSeenCents) {\n    Product product = inventory.product(productId);\n    if (product == null || qty <= 0 || qty > inventory.stock(productId).total()) {\n        return new CheckoutResult(CheckoutResult.Status.REJECTED, null,\n                \"Cannot sell \" + qty + \" of \" + productId);\n    }\n    if (product.priceCents() != priceSeenCents) {\n        return new CheckoutResult(CheckoutResult.Status.PRICE_CHANGED, null,\n                \"Price is now \" + product.priceCents() + \", was \" + priceSeenCents);\n    }\n    if (inventory.stock(productId).acquireOrWait(userId, qty)) {\n        return new CheckoutResult(CheckoutResult.Status.HELD, newHold(userId, product, qty),\n                \"Held for \" + holdTtlMillis / 1000 + \"s\");\n    }\n    return new CheckoutResult(CheckoutResult.Status.WAITLISTED, null,\n            \"Out of stock right now, you are on the waitlist\");\n}\n"
