      "file": "PaymentGateway.java",
      "body": "public interface PaymentGateway {\n    /** Must be idempotent on idempotencyKey: the same key never charges twice. */\n    boolean charge(String userId, long amountCents, String idempotencyKey);\n\n    void refund(String idempotencyKey);\n}\n"
