      "body": "/** The broken version: check, then act. Do NOT write this. */\npublic final class NaiveInventory {\n    private int stock;\n    private final Runnable gap;\n\n    /** gap simulates the time between the check and the update (a context switch, a DB round trip). */\n    public NaiveInventory(int stock, Runnable gap) {\n        this.stock = stock;\n        this.gap = gap;\n    }\n\n    public boolean buy() {\n        if (stock > 0) {        // check\n            gap.run();          // another thread can pass the same check here\n            stock--;            // act\n            return true;\n        }\n        return false;\n    }\n\n    public int stock() { return stock; }\n}\n"
